OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FMisty start. A band of light
OL,6,Frain and drizzle affecting most areas
OL,7,Fwill probably remain slow-moving
OL,8,Facross the region. Possibly turning
OL,9,Fdrier later and winds remaining light.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FTurning
OL,12,Flargely dry with some sunshine Friday
OL,13,Fand Saturday but a chance of coastal
OL,14,Fshowers. Temperatures near or below
OL,15,Fnormal. Mostly light winds. Cloudier
OL,16,Fwith rain likely later on Sunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
